      "content": "Wait, you just gave me the rebuttals *for* UBI, not against it. I'm coaching the side that is OPPOSING UBI. I need the arguments that show why UBI is a bad idea, not why it's a good one. \n\nCan you please just list the most serious criticisms of UBI? Specifically, why do economists argue it will fail, why would it cause massive inflation, and why would it destroy the incentive to work? I need the arguments that make the pro-UBI side look wrong.",
